# Borg Queen's enters trigger targets "a creature card from an opponent's
# graveyard" (CR 115.1, 404.1). Bot2's Thought Scour mills Memnite and
# Ornithopter, so Bot2's graveyard has two creature cards; Bot1's own Memnite
# was killed by Lightning Bolt, so Bot1's graveyard also has one. The own
# Memnite must be refused, and the opponent's Memnite is the one assimilated:
# it arrives under Bot1 with a +1/+1 counter, a Borg artifact creature, and
# Bot1's +2/+0 makes it 4/2. Bot1's own graveyard keeps its Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Borg Queen, Perfection Manifest
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Sapphire
Thought Scour
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island
Island
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x10

